{"id":"NCT06186856","title":"Epidemiological Data on Mast Cell Pathologies in France","official":"Epidemiological Data on Mast Cell Pathologies in France","summary":"Mast cell disorders constitute a heterogeneous group of diseases, including :\n\n* mastocytosis, i.e. cutaneous, indolent and severe forms of the disease, such as aggressive mastocytosis and mast cell leukemia) ;\n* mast cell-associated diseases such as mast cell activation syndrome (idiopathic, secondary or clonal), affecting both children and adults.\n\nNo epidemiological data are currently available in France.\n\nIn France, medical care of mast cell disorders is mainly provided by a rare disease network (CEREMAST), whose CRMR is located at the Necker Enfants Malades hospital in Paris. A total of 20 centers are located throughout France.\n\nOur aim is to use this network to study patients suffering from these diseases. The overall aim of the study is to improve the understanding, diagnosis, prognosis, recognition and management of patients with mastocytosis.","conditions":["Mast Cell Disorder"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n1. Children from birth and adults of any age\n2. With one of the following mast cell diseases:\n\n   * Mastocytoses (cutaneous, systemic and sarcomas) Defined according to the WHO 2016 classification\n   * Mast cell activation syndromes (idiopathic, secondary and clonal)\n   * Other mast cell activation disorders (MCAD-NOS), Defined according to the Vienna classification\n   * Pre-mastocytosis or MMC (1 to 2 criteria according to WHO 2016 classification).\n3. Managed in France in a rare disease reference, constitutive or competence center (CEREMAST) with DGOS labelization.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n1\\. Opposition of the patient or his/her parents to participation in the study.","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":13000,"start":"2024-11-01","pcd":"2038-12-31","upd":"2026-04-22","sponsor":"Imagine Institute","areas":["other","rare"],"central":["Julien Rossignol, Dr · +33 (0)1 44 49 40 00 · julien.rossignol@aphp.fr"],"sites":[{"f":"CHU AMIENS site sud","city":"Amiens","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":49.9,"lon":2.3,"c":"Clément GOURGUECHON, Dr · +33 (0)3 22 45 59 14 · Gourguechon.Clement@chu-amiens.fr"},{"f":"Chu Angers","city":"Angers","pr":"","zip":"49100","s":"R","lat":47.4716,"lon":-0.552,"c":"Christian Lavigne, Dr · +33 (0)2 41 35 36 37 · ChLavigne@chu-angers.fr"},{"f":"Chu - Besancon","city":"Besançon","pr":"","zip":"25000","s":"R","lat":47.2488,"lon":6.0182,"c":"Florence CASTELAIN, Dr · +33 (0)3 81 21 80 97 · fcastelain@chu-besancon.fr"},{"f":"Chu - Caen","city":"Caen","pr":"","zip":"14033","s":"R","lat":49.1859,"lon":-0.3591,"c":"Gandhi DAMAJ, Pr · +33 (0)2 31 27 21 07 · damaj-gl@chu-caen.fr"},{"f":"Chu - Clermont Ferrand","city":"Clermont-Ferrand","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":45.7797,"lon":3.0868,"c":"Olivier TOURNILHAC, Pr · +33 (0)4 73 75 00 74 · otournilhac@chu-clermontferrand.fr"},{"f":"CHU Grenoble","city":"Grenoble","pr":"","zip":"38700","s":"R","lat":45.1787,"lon":5.7148,"c":"Laurence BOUILLET, Pr · lbouillet@chu-grenoble.fr"},{"f":"Chru Lille","city":"Lille","pr":"","zip":"59037","s":"R","lat":50.6339,"lon":3.0551,"c":"David LAUNAY, Pr · +33 (0)3 20 44 42 96 · david.launay@chru-lille.fr"},{"f":"Chu - Limoges","city":"Limoges","pr":"","zip":"87000","s":"R","lat":45.8336,"lon":1.2476,"c":"Marie-Pierre GOURIN, Dr · +33 (0)5 55 05 66 42 · marie-pierre.gourin@chu-limoges.fr"},{"f":"Hospices Civils de Lyon","city":"Lyon","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":45.7491,"lon":4.8479,"c":"Maël Heiblig, Dr · mael.heiblig@chu-lyon.fr"},{"f":"Chu - La Timone - Marseille","city":"Marseille","pr":"","zip":"13005","s":"R","lat":43.297,"lon":5.3811,"c":"Caroline GAUDY, Pr · +33 (0)1 43 27 01 56 · Caroline.GAUDY@ap-hm.fr"},{"f":"CHU de Montpellier","city":"Montpellier","pr":"","zip":"34090","s":"R","lat":43.6109,"lon":3.8763,"c":"Philippe GUILPAIN, Pr · P-guilp